# Licenses

This repository contains material under two different regimes. Read both sections.

---

## 1. Project-specific source code — Apache License 2.0

Applies to code written for this project:

- `java/` — IMS bridge sources
- `c/` — `ims_sock_launch.c` and its build script
- `build.sh`
- `magisk-module/*.sh` — module scripts (`post-fs-data.sh`, `service.sh`, `customize.sh`)
- `magisk-module/sepolicy.rule`
- `selinux/` — convergence documentation, requirements ledger and the collector script
- `README.md`, `README.zh-CN.md`, `tools/README.md`

